## Testing Checklist

### Unit Testing

- [ ] All components have basic render tests
- [ ] Interactive components test user interactions
- [ ] Form components test validation and submission
- [ ] Redux reducers test all action types
- [ ] Redux selectors test various state conditions
- [ ] API services test success and error cases
- [ ] Utility functions test edge cases

### Integration Testing

- [ ] Navigation flows test screen transitions
- [ ] Form flows test complete user journeys
- [ ] Redux integration tests saga-reducer interactions
- [ ] API integration tests mock network calls
- [ ] Authentication flows test login/logout

### Coverage Requirements

- [ ] Minimum 80% code coverage
- [ ] 100% coverage for critical paths (auth, payments)
- [ ] All exported functions have tests
- [ ] Error handling paths are tested

### Testing Commands

```bash
# Run all tests
yarn test

# Run tests with coverage
yarn test:coverage

# Run tests in watch mode
yarn test --watch

# Run tests for specific file
yarn test SignInScreen

# Run tests matching pattern
yarn test --testNamePattern="should handle form submission"

# Debug tests
yarn test --detectOpenHandles --forceExit
```

